From b5aee21f8cd3e0605c14bea79ed2603ccabb8176 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@pypus.in>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 19:41:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add shared PageHeader + working per-module search; fix dead
 mobile search buttons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New components/layout/PageHeader.tsx: reusable title/subtitle/search/actions
  block used across Members, Fees, Attendance, Team, Expenses, Workspace pages
  (desktop), replacing the repeated ad hoc header markup on each page.
- Members, Fees, Attendance: search box moved into the header, state lifted
  where needed (FeesPaymentsTable, AttendanceRegister now take a controlled
  searchQuery prop instead of owning their own state).
- Team: added working search (filters by name/email/role) — previously had
  none.
- Expenses: added working search (filters by title/notes) — previously had
  none.
- Fix: mobile top-bar search icon on Attendance and Fees did nothing on tap
  (no onClick handler at all). It now scrolls to and focuses the real inline
  search field. This was the client-facing 'search not working' bug.
